      <td style="box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;width:365.6px;height:23px">Silent
      Talon</td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;height:23px">
      <td style="box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;width:143.2px;height:23px"><strong><span
      style="box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text">Other obvious features</span></strong></td>
      <td style="box-sizing:border-box;user-select:text;width:365.6px;height:23px">None</td>
      </tr>
      </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>Kôris’ the name. Just a soldier, nothing fancy about me. Been swinging this
      axe since I was a lad—first in the militia, then for the mercenary band. War
      is simple: protect those who fight with you, kill those who stand against you.
      That’s all there is to it. I’m not much for talk, and I don’t care for politics.
      You tell me who to fight, and I’ll get it done.</p>
      <p>Lost my home, my family, a long time ago. You could say I’ve been looking
      for something to fight for ever since. The band feels like home now, I suppose.
      Captain Brànwâal’s good at what he does—keeps us alive, pays us well enough.
      As long as I’m swinging my axe, I’m where I need to be.</p>
    biography: >-
